title: The opened folder is app/ inside the repository: line 2 and line 6 of src/util.rs staged, then line 2 unstaged; index must hold only 'n + n + n', other/thing.txt outside the folder stays unstaged
folders: git-subfolder/app
expect-file: git-subfolder/app/src/util.rs :: n \+ n\n\}\n\npub fn triple\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n    n \+ n \+ n\n
expect-file: git-subfolder/other/thing.txt :: ^one\nTWO\nthree\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/util.rs
wait 1200
part stage src/util.rs 2
wait 1500
part stage src/util.rs 6
wait 1500
mark both
wait 600
part unstage src/util.rs 2
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
